# Infrastructure

Do not flip accepted decisions in a drive-by. Do not document the fleet as
blocking-WAF HA with unified forward-auth.

**Do not "fix":**

- WAF DetectionOnly (`docs/adr/2026-08-29-waf-detection-only.md`)
- oauth2-proxy per-vhost, not fleet-wide
  (`docs/adr/2026-08-29-oauth2-proxy-coverage.md`)
- No Attic. Deploys build on the native builder and `nix copy` with
  `deploy-rs`. Host `nix.conf` uses `cache.nixos.org`
  (`docs/adr/2026-11-03-decommission-attic.md`)
- VMs 101, 102, 103, and 106 are destroyed. Do not recreate those
  NixOS guests. Do not `zfs destroy ssd/garage-iscsi` until the operator
  removes that zvol on TrueNAS
  (`docs/adr/2026-11-06-decommission-garage.md`)
- No staging; merge does not deploy. Operator activates with
  `make deploy*` (`docs/adr/2026-11-05-ci-lint-only.md`)
- Three hubs are SPOFs: `xcloud-postgres`, `xcloud-caddy`,
  `truenas-scale` (`docs/adr/2026-09-07-no-internal-lb.md`)

## Landmines (see runbooks; do not improvise)

- Substituters on deployed hosts are `https://cache.nixos.org`.
- Builder `nix copy` passes `narinfo-cache-negative-ttl 0`.
- Keycloak `/admin` needs a **tailnet source IP** at the edge, not merely
  Tailscale-up (`docs/services/keycloak.md`).
- **Do not empty Keycloak `parent_group`.** Top-level groups use a single
  space (`GroupEntity.TOP_PARENT_ID`). `''` NPEs `/token` and kills SSO
  plus the admin console (`docs/services/keycloak.md`).
